{"vnsave":1,"game":null,"seq":4,"saved_at":1793567040,"description":"Daichi: The fireworks don't start for a while. Ask me anyt\u2026","chapter":null,"game_version":"0.1.0","state_format":1,"thumb":9360,"state":7568}
{"jpeg":""}
{"format":1,"identity_scheme":1,"position":{"sid":"bridge_talk/b3d1f8e89b85","at":["bridge_talk",[0]]},"call_stack":[{"sid":"bridge/2109d790550d","at":["bridge",[10]]}],"variables":{"trust":1,"bought_lantern":true,"hana_name":"Hana","fortune":"small luck","asked_hana":true,"asked_bridge":false,"wish_for":null,"turns":9,"hana_at":"train","hana_shown":{"action":"present","statement":"train","evidence":"festival_map","correct":true},"hana_replies":{},"hana_here":false,"shed_state":{"action":"exit","hotspot":"door","item":null,"gone":[]}},"dice":"cdb2d7c80f4581e7","stage":{"background":"bg bridge_night","sprites":[{"tag":"daichi","image":"daichi grin","at":"right","layer":0,"zoom":1.0,"flip":false},{"tag":"hana","image":"hana pout","at":"left","layer":0,"zoom":1.0,"flip":false}]},"audio":{"music":[{"file":"bgm/bridge_night.wav","loop":true,"volume":100}],"sounds":[{"file":"sfx/river.wav","volume":40}]},"choices":{"picks":[{"menu":"lantern_stall/b47f6427b0c1","choice":"522cc85a5382","text":"Buy a lantern","question":"Three hundred yen. Hana is watching from the water."},{"menu":"lantern_stall/66e0bb08ed25","choice":"3c01206c5afc","text":"Red, like the shrine gate","question":"\"Red or white?\" the stall keeper asked."},{"menu":"bridge_talk/b3d1f8e89b85","choice":"890fd3e2a9bb","text":"Ask about Hana","question":"The fireworks don't start for a while. Ask me anything."}],"waiting":{"pickable":["54ce36c83653","7bbb4878a31c"],"locked":[],"kept":null}},"history":{"entries":[{"kind":"line","sid":"start/356325287da0","name":"","text":"The festival comes once a year, on the night the river runs slowest."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/5c1cc19fcdd2","name":"","text":"Every family folds a paper lantern, writes a wish on its side, and lets the water carry it away."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/0a28808ca782","name":"","text":"I hadn't been back in six years. Then Daichi called."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/c5e4f2859901","name":"Daichi","text":"Come for the lanterns. My cousin is visiting, and she keeps asking about you."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/8c1b34688ada","name":"","text":"I said I would think about it. I had already bought the ticket."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/57033e351280","name":"","text":"Three days later, the train left me at the bridge with one bag and no plan."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/74d80faa4a38","name":"","text":"The river was louder than I remembered."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/ff5c3b71c940","name":"","text":"The festival lanterns were already lit when I reached the river."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/c24e1d128d68","name":"???","text":"You came! I didn't think you would."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/40b2ab1774ea","name":"???","text":"Oh, sorry. I'm Hana. Daichi's cousin."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/a815fa8300c5","name":"Hana","text":"He said you'd get lost at least twice."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/d2d88d765e0d","name":"Hana","text":"So I drew you a map."},{"kind":"line","sid":"start/aa0b8bc3f844","name":"","text":"Only once. Well, twice."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/f09822ffb3ca","name":"Hana","text":"Oh, and I left something for you, in your game folder. Look in the characters folder."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/da751fec11f2","name":"Hana","text":"That's me in there. hana.chr. Don't open it, it's private."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/9eedb6ccaa82","name":"Hana","text":"...Huh. Did I just disappear from your folder?"},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/c7f9e3fdbe3a","name":"Hana","text":"There's a copy of me in the files folder. You could put me back, if you like."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/63faa041a166","name":"","text":"I wasn't sure what she meant. I let her go on anyway."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_file/085b0b9dbf4d","name":"Hana","text":"Never mind. A new game always brings me back."},{"kind":"line","sid":"riverbank/2444a8da9af1","name":"","text":"Paper lanterns drifted past us one by one, each carrying somebody's wish downstream."},{"kind":"line","sid":"riverbank/2e384d131f0e","name":"Hana","text":"Did you write one? Everybody writes one. But first, a fortune."},{"kind":"line","sid":"draw_fortune/94b4bda3deac","name":"","text":"\"One fortune, one hundred yen,\" the stall keeper said."},{"kind":"line","sid":"draw_fortune/795f993a80c2","name":"","text":"I unrolled the paper and read it twice: small luck."},{"kind":"line","sid":"riverbank/3a4987e224ea","name":"Daichi","text":"Small luck. Only Hana believes in those paper slips."},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/6a99b9113d70","name":"","text":"\"Three hundred yen,\" the stall keeper said. \"Wishes are extra.\""},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/07944179b2a0","name":"","text":"\"Unless you can find the pairs,\" she added, and turned a row of paper lanterns face down."},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/94e9e5c81bdc","name":"","text":"\"Only 9 turns? Sharp eyes,\" the stall keeper said. \"Your wish is free.\""},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/b47f6427b0c1","name":"","text":"Three hundred yen. Hana is watching from the water."},{"kind":"choice","sid":"lantern_stall/b47f6427b0c1","name":"","text":"Buy a lantern"},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/66e0bb08ed25","name":"","text":"\"Red or white?\" the stall keeper asked."},{"kind":"choice","sid":"lantern_stall/66e0bb08ed25","name":"","text":"Red, like the shrine gate"},{"kind":"line","sid":"lantern_stall/b22b51e4f01e","name":"","text":"I took the red one. It glowed like a coal in my hands."},{"kind":"line","sid":"festival_shed/5f49be261ecf","name":"","text":"\"Candles are in the shed, if you want your lantern to last,\" the stall keeper said, and nodded at a door behind the stall."},{"kind":"line","sid":"riverbank/e9846a507fa6","name":"Hana","text":"Oh. You bought one. That's... nice."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge/59d101b6bdb7","name":"","text":"The old footbridge creaked under the crowd. Halfway across, Daichi leaned on the rail and watched the water."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge/53599abcf41d","name":"Daichi","text":"There you are. Hana's been looking for you all evening."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge/a79b061dfd68","name":"Hana","text":"I have not. I've been looking for a good spot to let the lanterns go."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge/c6a181c6c293","name":"","text":"That wasn't what Daichi had said on the phone."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_testimony/c7d8cf49db41","name":"Hana","text":"That's my map! Where did you..."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_testimony/11a4682cb7c2","name":"","text":"Her handwriting, in the corner: when my train got in."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_testimony/051d6da1f1c3","name":"Hana","text":"Fine. Maybe I asked about you. Twice."},{"kind":"line","sid":"hana_testimony/6131c89d419f","name":"Daichi","text":"Eleven times."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge_talk/b3d1f8e89b85","name":"Daichi","text":"The fireworks don't start for a while. Ask me anything."},{"kind":"choice","sid":"bridge_talk/b3d1f8e89b85","name":"","text":"Ask about Hana"},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge_talk/7e5931169bc7","name":"Daichi","text":"She practiced saying hello to you all afternoon."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge_talk/2a1e63715640","name":"Hana","text":"I can hear you, you know."},{"kind":"line","sid":"bridge_talk/b3d1f8e89b85","name":"Daichi","text":"The fireworks don't start for a while. Ask me anything."}]},"chapter":{"current":"bridge"},"points":{"values":{"hana":3,"daichi":1,"credibility":3}},"rollback":{"enabled":true},"nvl":{"on":false,"page":[]},"items":{"held":["festival_map","fortune_slip","lantern"]},"minigame":{"waiting":null},"flow":{"path":[]},"glitch":{"on":[]}}
